    params[1]: [[5, 6], [7, 8]]
    params[2]: [[9, 10]]
    ```

    and `ids` is:

    ```python
    [0, 3, 4]
    ```

    The output will be a 3x2 matrix:

    ```python
    [[1, 2], [7, 8], [9, 10]]
